{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"E2 代数"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"E2-代数"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb E_2$-代数是"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":"中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":", 是若干元素可以<strong>放在二维平面上</strong>结合起来的结构. 给定 $n$ 个元素 $x_1,\\cdots,x_n$, 对二维平面上的 $n$ 个点的每种构形, 都有一种方法将它们结合起来.</p>\n<p>$\\mathbb E_2$-代数是 "},{"Local":{"url":"En-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_n$-代数"}},{"Plain":"的 $n=2$ 情形.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>在 $1$-范畴中, 由 "},{"Local":{"url":"Eckmann--Hilton论证","text":"Eckmann–Hilton 论证"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathbb E_2$-代数等同于"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>范畴的范畴 $(\\mathsf{Cat},\\times)$ 中的 $\\mathbb E_2$-代数称为<strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"辫幺半范畴","text":"辫幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" (braided monoidal category).</p>\n"}]}}